  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chalmers and Department Water Affairs groundwater recharge in Botswana</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Chalmers/Department Water Affairs grundvatten</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet som &#xE4;r ett samarbete mellan Chalmers Tekniska H&#xF6;gskola och  botswanska Department for Water Affairs (DWA), har som m&#xE5;l att under  ett &#xE5;r ta fram en modell f&#xF6;r konstgjord grundvattenbildning. Sida     bed&#xF6;mer att insatsen, inom ramen f&#xF6;r akt&#xF6;rssamverkan, &#xE4;r i linje med  Sveriges samarbetsstrategi med Botswana 2009-2013, d&#xE4;r milj&#xF6; och      klimat &#xE4;r ett av tre prioriterade omr&#xE5;den.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a cooperation between Chalmers University of           Technology and Botswana&apos;s Department for Water Affairs (DWA). The     goal of the cooperation is to develop a model for artificial          groundwater recharge. Sida assess the contribution, which falls       within the framework of Partner Driven Cooperation (PDC), to be in    line with the strategy for selective cooperation with Botswana.</narrative>
  </description>
